{"script":"sj_011_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":160,"y":-206,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":160,"transTime":300,"y":-206,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎想向秘术师型的契约者们请教控制魔力的技巧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]虽然妈妈的魔法知识比学者们还要丰富，但缇莎还是想接触一些不同视角的技巧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]而且，缇莎想要悄悄努力一下，好给妈妈一个惊喜！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]不过缇莎总是控制不好魔力。在这里练习魔法的话，有可能会把这么漂亮的营地破坏掉的。[r]要是能没有顾虑的练习魔法就好了，呜呜呜。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]唉？“有必要研究一下能耐受高强度魔力冲击的建筑外壳”？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]给营地所有建筑都铺上厚厚的反魔法护甲？这样就不怕缇莎乱放魔法了？[r]还、还有这种东西吗！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]感、感觉……米托拉姐姐应该不会喜欢吧……哈、哈哈……[r]不、不用了啦，不用现在就跑去说服米托拉姐姐的！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]“是真的想帮助缇莎”吗……[r]谢谢你，{myName}……这么认真地考虑缇莎的事。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎会想办法，在不打扰到大家的前提下练习的！[r]毕竟缇莎未来可是绝对不需要妈妈和{myName}担心的大秘术师嘛！[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":160,"transTime":300,"y":-206,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"缇莎-（有没有想在这里做的事？）"}